  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cleanmax TH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed IFC investment is to support Cleanmax Energy (Thailand) Co. Ltd (CMTH) a wholly owned subsidiary of Clean Max Enviro Energy Solutions Pvt. Ltd. (CMES), on the development of 72 MW of rooftop solar plants in Thailand supplying power to commercial and industrial (C&amp;I) clients through long term power purchase agreements (PPA) (the Project).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project is expected to reduce greenhouse gas emissions, improve supply reliability and reduce power cost for consumers with some grid independence. Beyond the project, this investment could improve the market competitiveness by supporting a growing RE player.</narrative>
  </description>
